cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it and the experimental paper that provides its data."
title: "Material Hardness & Oxidation Prediction"
abstract: >-
  A paper-grounded machine-learning demonstration for Stellite-6 TIG hardfacing.
  The service reports exploratory hardness and cumulative areal oxidation mass
  gain estimates only at the conditions reported in Chandra et al. (2020), and
  documents the unresolved unit, sign, and independence issues in the source
  table values.
type: software
authors:
